d 'RCSARDL': module to provide Robust Cross-Sectionally Augmented ARDL adjustment estimator
d
d      rcsardl implements the point-estimation algorithm of the
d RCS-ARDL approach described by Zehra Yalnız (2026). The command
d first    estimates a conventional CS-ARDL model using xtdcce2.
d The conventional CS-ARDL long-run coefficient vector is retained 
d   unchanged. Robustification is applied only to the
d equilibrium-adjustment component.    Conditional on the
d conventional CS-ARDL long-run coefficients, the command
d constructs the lagged equilibrium error and	 estimates a robust
d error-correction regression separately for each panel unit using
d Stata's rreg. The robust stage includes    cross-sectional
d medians of the dependent-variable change, explanatory-variable
d changes, and lagged equilibrium error. 
d
d KW: ARDL
d KW: cross-section
d KW: robust
d
d Requires: Stata version 17 and xtdcce2 from SSC (q.v.)
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260928
d
d Author:  Zehra Yalnız,  Kocaeli University
d Support: email zehrayalnizz41@@gmail.com
d
f rcsardl.ado
f rcsardl.sthlp
f rcsardl_example.do
f rcsardl_oecd_validation.do
